      "title": "D04 Stable Core Planned Closure",
      "items": [
        "five closed DeliveryOperationId values map deterministically to canonical skills/delivery/** HOW",
        "DeliveryGuidanceRef freezes exact content identity into the minimal DeliveryOperationPackage",
        "Delivery Start creates a clean fixed-point commit before Change execution; later operations reuse the same package pattern"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "One Execution Pattern, Two Lifecycle Levels",
      "items": [
        "Action: Policy/existing Action facts → StandardActionId → ActionPackage → Agent",
        "Delivery: existing Delivery boundary / explicit caller / Owner authority where required → DeliveryOperationId → DeliveryOperationPackage → Agent",
        "WHAT is decided before HOW；Agent never discovers, ranks, routes, or chooses the operation"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "No New Control Plane",
      "items": [
        "same 21 components / same boundaries / same connection topology；responsibility contracts converge across existing seams",
        "no Skill Registry/Router/Planner, Agent-facing Delivery Skill projection requirement, second Delivery lifecycle, or candidate identity subsystem",
        ".agents bootstrap remains independent；state-first conditional transport and explicit Owner Git authority remain frozen"
      ]
    }
